# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deus Vision Radar reproduce
# Detection-only reproduce of HKUST RM2025 radar (YOLO26 + two-stage).
# Keep source in git. Keep weights, datasets, videos, and sim binaries local.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

